          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そしてお世話になったテイチクの皆様、本当に今年はありがとうございました。来年もよろしくお願いいたします(´∀｀=)！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "还有一直关照我的Teichiku的大家，今年真的非常感谢。明年也请多多关照(´∀｀=)！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "And to everyone at Teichiku who looked after me, thank you so much for this year. I look forward to working with you next year too(´∀｀=)!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "明日の冬コミもみんなとこんな風に写真撮るの楽しみだ〜。寒いから風邪ひかないでね！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "明天在冬Comi上，也很期待能像这样和大家一起拍照片呀〜。天冷了，别感冒哦！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm looking forward to taking photos like this with you all at tomorrow's Winter Comiket too. It's cold, so don't catch a cold!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
